  "bodyHash": "12a4fbe336a198d8",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">GUI Compass 是一款簡潔且可自訂的客戶端模組，可在物品欄中透過羅盤於圖形介面顯示方向與座標。預設情況下羅盤位於左上角，但您可以在設定檔中更改其位置與高度。<br><br>螢幕上顯示的格式可透過 'guiCompassFormat' 設定值進行調整。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>預設格式：</strong>&nbsp;<em>方向：X, Y, Z<br><br></em>您也可以對 <span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gui-clock\" rel=\"nofollow\">GUI Clock（圖形介面時鐘）</a></strong></span> 感興趣。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/client-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum&#x27;s 客戶端套件\" width=\"359\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg\" alt=\"環境：客戶端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可自訂\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>guiCompassFormat</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 \"FXYZ\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">要顯示 GUI 羅盤的哪些資訊。預設：[FXYZ]。F：朝向（方向），X：X 座標，Y：Y 座標（深度），Z：Z 座標。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHaveCompassInInventory</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;啟用後，僅在物品欄中有羅盤時才會顯示 GUI 羅盤。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>compassPositionIsLeft</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;將 GUI 羅盤置於左側。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>compassPositionIsCenter</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;將 GUI 羅盤置於中間。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>compassPositionIsRight</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;將 GUI 羅盤置於右側。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>compassHeightOffset</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 5，最小 0，最大 3000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;羅盤的垂直偏移量（Y 座標）。這決定了座標與方向在螢幕上的顯示位置。可調整以避免圖形介面重疊。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>drawTextShadow</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">顯示的文字下方是否繪製陰影。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RGB_R</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 255，最小 0，最大 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;羅盤的紅色 RGB 值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RGB_G</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 255，最小 0，最大 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;羅盤的綠色 RGB 值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RGB_B</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 255，最小 0，最大 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;羅盤的藍色 RGB 值。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><strong>玩家旋轉時羅盤的範例：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-compass/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"292\" height=\"64\"></strong></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內，您即可自由在任何整合包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於評論分散在多個不同的模組頁面，難以追蹤，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他需求，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 倉儲</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
